### -------------------------------------------
### PUBLISH TOURNAMENT
### -------------------------------------------

### 14) Publish tournament success 200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tournaments/8/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

### 15) Publish tournament FAILED - not found 404
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tournaments/999/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

### 16) Publish tournament FAILED - not in PREPARATION 409
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tournaments/2/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

### 17) Publish tournament FAILED - not admin 403
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tournaments/1/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}